BUG: Worker Routes Return 404 (Wrong APIRouter Selected)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SYMPTOMS:
  - App loads successfully (worker starts)
  - GET /api/app/file_editor_cm6/state returns 404 Not Found
  - GET /api/app/file_editor_cm6/git/branches returns 404 Not Found
  - Only 17 routes registered instead of expected 48+
  - Worker log shows only agent_routes_bp loaded (13 routes)

ROOT CAUSE:
  - app_worker.py loops through dir(module) looking for ANY APIRouter
  - Finds 'agent_routes_bp' first (alphabetically before 'file_editor_cm6_bp')
  - Stops at first match, never loads main router
  - agent_routes_bp is a sub-router included IN file_editor_cm6_bp
  - Result: Only agent routes registered, missing all main app routes

CONVERSATION SUMMARY:
  1. User reported routes returning 404 despite worker starting
  2. Agent added diagnostics to app_worker.py (Phase 1 of plan)
  3. Diagnostics revealed only agent_routes_bp (13 routes) being loaded
  4. Agent identified alphabetical ordering issue in router selection
  5. Proposed fix: Look for router matching {app_id}_bp naming pattern
  6. User approved fix implementation
  7. Agent modified app_worker.py to prioritize exact name match
  8. User restarted framework, routes now load correctly
  9. New issue discovered: Some routes return 500 (missing imports)

FILES MODIFIED:
  - app/libs/app_worker.py
      * Added expected_router_name = f"{args.app_id}_bp"
      * Changed loop to look for exact name match instead of first APIRouter
      * Added detailed DEBUG logging for router discovery
      * Updated error message to indicate expected router name

FIX APPLIED:
  ✓ app_worker.py now looks for router with exact name match
  ✓ Prioritizes file_editor_cm6_bp over sub-routers
  ✓ 48 routes now registered (44 app routes + 4 FastAPI built-ins)
  ✓ Worker starts successfully with correct router

VERIFICATION (After Restart):
  - DEBUG: Found APIRouter 'file_editor_cm6_bp' with 44 routes → SUCCESS
  - DEBUG: FastAPI app has 48 total routes → SUCCESS
  - GET /api/app/file_editor_cm6/state → 200 OK ✓
  - GET /api/app/file_editor_cm6/read → 200 OK ✓
  - POST /api/app/file_editor_cm6/write → 200 OK ✓
  - POST /api/app/file_editor_cm6/state/file_activity → 200 OK ✓

REMAINING ISSUES:
  ✗ GET /api/app/file_editor_cm6/diff → 500 Internal Server Error
      Error: NameError: name 'collect_diff' is not defined (line 494)
  ✗ GET /api/app/file_editor_cm6/git/status → 500 Internal Server Error
  ✗ GET /api/app/file_editor_cm6/git/branches → 500 Internal Server Error
  ✗ GET /api/app/file_editor_cm6/explorer/list → 500 Internal Server Error
  ✗ Root cause: Missing function imports in main.py for route handlers

